msgid ""
msgstr ""
"# 治理\n"
"\n"
"## 项目治理\n"
"\n"
"本项目的治理模式旨在确保透明、负责和可持续的发展。所有贡献者、维护者和用户都应遵守本文件中概述的原则和流程。\n"
"\n"
"## 角色与职责\n"
"\n"
"### 维护者\n"
"维护者负责项目的日常管理，包括审查和合并拉取请求、处理问题以及维护项目路线图。维护者由现有维护者根据其贡献、专业知识和社区参与情况任命。\n"
"\n"
"### 贡献者\n"
"贡献者是提交拉取请求、报告问题或参与讨论的个人。欢迎任何遵循贡献指南的人士贡献。\n"
"\n"
"### 用户\n"
"用户是使用该项目的人。我们鼓励用户提供反馈、报告问题并参与社区讨论。\n"
"\n"
"## 决策流程\n"
"\n"
"### 共识决策\n"
"项目决策力求在维护者之间达成共识。如果无法达成共识，则通过多数票决定，维护者拥有最终决定权。\n"
"\n"
"### 提案\n"
"重大变更或新功能应通过提案流程提交。提案应概述变更内容、理由和潜在影响。提案将在实施前由维护者讨论。\n"
"\n"
"## 行为准则\n"
"\n"
"所有参与者都应遵守项目的行为准则，该准则促进一个尊重和包容的环境。违反行为准则的行为应向维护者报告。\n"
"\n"
"## 冲突解决\n"
"\n"
"如果贡献者与维护者之间或维护者之间出现冲突，应首先尝试通过直接沟通解决。如果冲突无法解决，可升级至项目所有者或指定的仲裁人。\n"
"\n"
"## 变更管理\n"
"\n"
"### 版本控制\n"
"项目遵循语义化版本控制。破坏性变更仅在主版本中引入。次要版本添加向后兼容的功能，补丁版本包含向后兼容的错误修复。\n"
"\n"
"### 变更日志\n"
"所有显著变更均记录在变更日志中。变更日志在每次发布时更新。\n"
"\n"
"## 发布流程\n"
"\n"
"### 发布计划\n"
"发布计划由维护者确定，并基于路线图和社区需求。发布公告提前发出，以便用户做好准备。\n"
"\n"
"### 发布候选版本\n"
"在正式发布之前，发布候选版本将提供给社区进行测试。反馈将被收集，并纳入最终发布。\n"
"\n"
"## 财务治理\n"
"\n"
"### 资金\n"
"项目可能接受捐赠或赞助。所有财务交易均透明记录，并定期向社区报告。\n"
"\n"
"### 支出\n"
"资金的使用方式应使项目受益，例如支付基础设施成本或支持开发工作。支出由维护者批准，并记录在案。\n"
"\n"
"## 法律合规\n"
"\n"
"### 许可\n"
"项目在开源许可下发布。所有贡献者必须同意其贡献根据项目许可获得许可。\n"
"\n"
"### 知识产权\n"
"贡献者保留其贡献的知识产权，但授予项目根据项目许可使用、修改和分发其贡献的权利。\n"
"\n"
"## 社区参与\n"
"\n"
"### 沟通渠道\n"
"项目使用各种沟通渠道，包括邮件列表、论坛和聊天平台。所有渠道均遵循行为准则。\n"
"\n"
"### 反馈\n"
"欢迎社区反馈，并用于改进项目。反馈可通过问题、讨论或调查提交。\n"
"\n"
"## 审查与改进\n"
"\n"
"### 定期审查\n"
"治理模式定期审查，以确保其有效性和相关性。审查结果将传达给社区。\n"
"\n"
"### 修订\n"
"治理模式的修订通过提案流程提出，并需要维护者批准。\n"

msgid "治理机制"
msgstr "Governance mechanism"

msgid "使命"
msgstr "Mission"

msgid "作为 Triton 生态的重要组成部分，Triton-Ascend 项目致力于为所有昇腾 NPU 用户提供高效易用的 Triton 编译框架，使 Triton 代码能够在昇腾硬件上高效运行，并积极贡献于丰富 Triton 和昇腾生态。"
msgstr "As an important component of the Triton ecosystem, the Triton-Ascend project is dedicated to providing an efficient and easy-to-use Triton compilation framework for all Ascend NPU users, enabling Triton code to run efficiently on Ascend hardware, and actively contributing to enriching the Triton and Ascend ecosystems."

msgid "原则"
msgstr "Principles"

msgid "**开放透明**：所有技术决策和社区讨论均通过公开渠道进行"
msgstr "**Openness and Transparency**: All technical decisions and community discussions are conducted through public channels."

msgid "**贡献导向**：成员资格基于个人能力和贡献，而非与雇主绑定"
msgstr "**Contribution-Oriented**: Membership is based on individual capability and contribution, rather than being tied to one's employer."

msgid "**社区驱动**：鼓励广泛参与，尊重多元观点，通过讨论和投票达成共识"
msgstr "**Community-Driven**: Broad participation is encouraged, diverse perspectives are respected, and consensus is reached through discussion and voting."

msgid "治理结构"
msgstr "Governance Structure"

msgid "Triton-Ascend 是 Triton 社区下的开源项目，角色任命最终由 Triton 社区决定。项目采用分层技术治理结构："
msgstr "Triton-Ascend is an open-source project under the Triton community, and role appointments are ultimately determined by the Triton community. The project adopts a layered technical governance structure:"

msgid "贡献者"
msgstr "Contributors"

msgid "**职责**："
msgstr "**Responsibilities**:"

msgid "帮助新贡献者融入项目"
msgstr "Help new contributors integrate into the project."

msgid "处理和回应社区 `Issue`"
msgstr "Handling and responding to community `Issues`."

msgid "审阅 `RFC` 和代码"
msgstr "Review `RFC` and code."

msgid "**要求**："
msgstr "**Requirements**:"

msgid "完成至少一次贡献"
msgstr "Complete at least one contribution."

msgid "通过提交 `Issue`、代码评审、代码提交和参与社区活动等方式持续积极参与项目"
msgstr "Actively participate in the project by submitting `Issues`, conducting code reviews, making code commits, and engaging in community activities."

msgid "**权限**：授予 GitHub 仓库 `Triage` 角色，包括读取和克隆权限，以及提交 Issue 和 PR 的权限。"
msgstr "**Permissions**: Grant the `Triage` role to the GitHub repository, including read and clone permissions, as well as permission to submit Issues and PRs."

msgid "Maintainer"
msgstr "Maintainer"

msgid "定义项目的愿景和使命，塑造技术方向，确保长期成功"
msgstr "Define the project's vision and mission, shape the technical direction, and ensure long-term success."

msgid "拥有代码合并权限，主导路线图规划"
msgstr "Has code merge permissions and leads roadmap planning."

msgid "审阅社区贡献并持续改进代码"
msgstr "Review community contributions and continuously improve the code."

msgid "负责核心模块的代码质量和架构决策"
msgstr "Responsible for code quality and architectural decisions of core modules."

msgid "参与发布决策"
msgstr "Participate in release decision-making."

msgid "指导贡献者完成代码贡献"
msgstr "Guide contributors through the process of making code contributions."

msgid "参与社区技术会议，讨论和投票技术方向、重大提案及 `Release` 事项"
msgstr "Participate in community technical meetings to discuss and vote on technical direction, major proposals, and `Release` matters."

msgid "对 Triton 和 Triton-Ascend 代码库有深入理解"
msgstr "Deep understanding of the Triton and Triton-Ascend codebases."

msgid "承诺持续代码贡献，具备设计、开发及 PR 审阅流程的能力"
msgstr "Commit to continuous code contributions, with the ability to handle design, development, and PR review processes."

msgid "积极参与社区代码评审，至少交付一项重大功能，并保持持续高质量贡献"
msgstr "Actively participate in community code reviews, deliver at least one major feature, and maintain sustained high-quality contributions."

msgid "积极处理 `Issue`、回应咨询并参与讨论"
msgstr "Actively handle `Issues`, respond to inquiries, and participate in discussions."

msgid "对项目做出重大技术贡献（如核心功能开发、架构设计、性能优化等）"
msgstr "Made significant technical contributions to the project (e.g., core feature development, architecture design, performance optimization, etc.)."

msgid "展现良好的技术判断力和社区协作能力"
msgstr "Demonstrate sound technical judgment and community collaboration skills."

msgid "**权限**：授予 GitHub 仓库写入权限，包括读取、克隆和推送代码权限，核心分支保护和合并权限，发布执行权限，以及管理 `Issue` 和 `Pull Request` 的权限。"
msgstr "**Permissions**: Grant write access to the GitHub repository, including permissions to read, clone, and push code, core branch protection and merge permissions, release execution permissions, as well as permissions to manage `Issues` and `Pull Requests`."

msgid "晋升由现有 `Maintainer` 共同评审，综合考虑贡献质量、连续性和社区参与度。"
msgstr "Promotion is jointly reviewed by existing `Maintainer`s, taking into account contribution quality, continuity, and community engagement."

msgid "提名与移除"
msgstr "Nomination and Removal"

msgid "成员资格基于个人能力，通过贡献、评审和讨论体现"
msgstr "Membership is based on individual capability, demonstrated through contributions, reviews, and discussions."

msgid "候选人需认同 Triton-Ascend 的原则并保持行为一致性"
msgstr "Candidates must identify with the principles of Triton-Ascend and maintain consistency in their actions."

msgid "连续 **6 个月** 未对项目做出贡献的 `Maintainer` 可转为荣誉身份"
msgstr "A `Maintainer` who has not contributed to the project for **6 consecutive months** may be converted to honorary status."

msgid "成员资格授予个人，不与雇主绑定"
msgstr "Membership is granted to individuals and is not tied to their employers."

msgid "提名流程"
msgstr "Nomination Process"

msgid "任何人均可发起提名，包括自提名，通过社区 `Issue` 进行"
msgstr "Anyone can initiate a nomination, including self-nomination, through a community `Issue`."

msgid "提名须包含候选人的贡献记录和技术能力说明"
msgstr "Nominations must include a description of the candidate's contributions and technical capabilities."

msgid "现有 `Maintainer` 审阅评估，需 **超过半数当前Maintainer同意且无反对意见**"
msgstr "Current `Maintainer` review assessment requires **more than half of the current Maintainers to agree, with no objections**."

msgid "定期审查"
msgstr "Regular review"

msgid "**每月** 在技术会议上审查所有 `Maintainer` 的活跃情况"
msgstr "**Monthly** review of all `Maintainer` activity at the technical meeting."

msgid "连续 **6 个月** 未对项目做出贡献的 `Maintainer` 可在讨论后转为荣誉身份"
msgstr "A `Maintainer` who has not contributed to the project for **6 consecutive months** may, after discussion, be transitioned to honorary status."

msgid "`荣誉` `Maintainer` 可随时通过恢复活跃贡献申请恢复 `Maintainer` 身份"
msgstr "`Honorary` `Maintainer` may apply to restore their `Maintainer` status at any time by resuming active contributions."
